EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Case.Successor__r.Name},

This is our third attempt to reach you regarding the Donor-Advised Fund account held by {!Case.Account.Name}.

It has been over two months since we first contacted you. As the designated successor, we need your input to properly handle this account. If we are unable to reach you, the account will be handled according to our organizational policies and the original donor's instructions.

ACCOUNT INFORMATION:
• Account Number: {!Case.FinServ__FinancialAccount__r.FinServ__FinancialAccountNumber__c}
• Approximate Balance: {!Case.FinServ__FinancialAccount__r.FinServ__Balance__c}
• Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
• Days Since Initial Contact: 65+ days

If we do not receive a response from you within 30 days, we will proceed with account processing per our standard procedures and the original donor's stated charitable preferences.

HOW TO REACH US:
Please contact us at 1-800-746-2227 and reference Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}. We are available Monday-Friday, 9am-5pm Eastern Time.

We are here to help you understand your options and answer any questions you may have.

Sincerely,

{!Case.Owner.Name}
Estate Administration Team
DAFGiving360
Phone: 1-800-746-2227
Email: {!Case.Owner.Email}
Case Number: {!Case.CaseNumber}
